    "note": "**Two fixes: the info bar cut-off (template) + the black-canvas preview (app).**\n\n**1 · Info bar — fits + tighter.** Each metric's label/value bands are now sized to their CHAR COUNT (not a fixed split), and the metric font is a touch smaller — so nothing clips: `canvas 1920×1080` and `min feasible 9×2 px` render in full. Metrics sit **closer to `Parsing`** (tightened the gap after the divider). *(Verified all 8 metrics fit their cells.)*\n\n**2 · Geometric preview black canvas — FIXED (needs a WEB rebuild).** The preview was painting the canvas's transparent overlay tracks (the `color=black@0,drawbox=…` divider + cursor lavfi) as opaque black, hiding the tiles. `GeometricPreview` now detects a **transparent base** (`color=…@0`) even with drawbox ops after it and renders that layer transparent — so the DSL frames on layer 0 show through in `layer: all`. (The actual video render was always correct; this was preview-only.)\n\n*(8×8 rendered well per your note — the camera pan + zoom-out are premium and confirmed. 174 + 11 tests green.)*\n\n**Rebuild both:** `npm --workspace ./packages/templates run build` (info bar) and rebuild the **web app** (preview fix).",
